Weapons:

A pair of unaligned artifact short swords that can be used for
#twoweapon combat together.  Receiving either of them as a gift from
your diety unrestricts the two-weapon skill, in addition to the short
sword skill.  Invoking either one of them summons the other.  If the
one you invoke was wielded, and there's not a weapon in your off hand,
and you're not wearing a shield, the summoned sword appears in your
off-hand, wielded for two-weapon combat.  Otherwise it just appears in
your inventory.  Either way, if your knapsack cannot accommodate any
more items, the summoned sword clatters to the floor at your feet.
These swords should have a pretty good to-hit bonus, but I'm not sure
what their damage bonus should be.  Obviously, they're not going to be
the most powerful weapons in the game, because they are short swords,
albeit artifact ones.  They should be better than most non-artifact
weapons, though: the game doesn't need more junk artifacts along the
lines of Grimtooth and Sting.


